~ start
Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
Nathan: Here are some choices.
- First one
	Nathan: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	Nathan: You picked the second one.
- Start again => start
- End the conversation => END
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
=> END

~ setup_start
Oak: Hello! Sorry to keep you waiting!
Oak: Welcome to the world of Pokémon.
Oak: My name is Oak.
Oak: People call me the Pokémon Professor.
=> setup_help

~ setup_help
Oak: If you need help, I am certainly capable of giving it.
- Controls
	Oak: TODO
	=> setup_help
- Adventure
	Oak: TODO
	=> setup_help
- No info needed
$> Setup.show_marill()
Oak: This world is inhabited by creatures we call Pokémon.
Oak: People and Pokémon live together by supporting each other.
Oak: Some people play with Pokémon, some battle with them.
$> Setup.show_oak()
Oak: But we don't know everything about Pokémon yet.
Oak: There are still many mysteries to solve.
Oak: That's why I study Pokémon every day.
$> Setup.hide_all()
Oak: Are you a boy or a girl?
- Boy
	$> Setup.show_boy()
- Girl
	$> Setup.show_girl()
Oak: Now what did you say your name was?
=> name_input

~ name_input
$> Setup.get_name_input()
Oak: So you're {{Setup.temp_name}}?
- Yes
- No
	Oak: What is your name?
	=> name_input
Oak: {{Setup.temp_name}}, are you ready?
Oak: Your very own Pokémon story is about to unfold.
Oak: You'll face fun times and tough challenges.
Oak: A world full of dreams and adventures with Pokémon awaits! Let's go!
$>> Setup.finalize()
=> END
